    <briefdescription>
<para>Filesystem data ingester. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Reads documents from local filesystem with OCR support for scanned PDFs. Supports multiple formats: PDF, DOCX, TXT, HTML, XML, JSON.</para>
<para>Example usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_file_system_ingester_1a3bfac90854710f35360f5d37cf903c1c" kindref="member">FileSystemIngester</ref><sp/>ingester;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">SourceConfig<sp/>config{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.source_id<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;custom_docs&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.type<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1ingestion_1ac26ea3ec62832c4278b31929df0e755fa8c4bad9563596861cd35a1829152b866" kindref="member">SourceType::FILESYSTEM</ref>,</highlight></codeline>
